+    // reason: the shell and the engine are separate translation units that agree on this
+    // struct only by layout.
+    //
+    // `hand_ofs` is in the IDENTICAL form as `eyeofs` — head-local forward/right/up, world
+    // units, measured from the play-space origin — so the viewmodel mount below is the eye
+    // composition with the hand's offset substituted for the eye's. Hands, eyes and weapon
+    // therefore live in one frame BY CONSTRUCTION rather than because two derivations were
+    // checked against each other, which is the mistake three donor bugs share.
+    //
+    // There are TWO angle sets on purpose. `hand_ang` carries the grip calibration and places
